WEBVTT

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.290
Is that the First Person?
I can't see very well.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.550
What was that?

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.640
The whole trunk is moving!

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.890
Rin-san! Run, Rin-san!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.910
Hey, this way!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.620
It reacts to Kemurikusa. Then how's this?

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:09.110
I knew it. It reacts to
the stronger Kemurikusa first.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.070
I have to distract it
until Rin-san wakes up.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.320
I have to touch the trunk and...

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:42.100
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:48.980
Long night will continue on

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:52.570
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:55.940
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:15.380
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:22.180
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:29.190
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:37.030
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:44.160
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:51.250
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:57.630
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.050
Endless agony

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:05.310
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.620
Hey!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.800
You saved me.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.090
-Are you okay?
-Yes.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:44.390
I put Midori-san here
before it penetrated me.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.720
So this is the red tree.
The trunk is moving?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.520
Yes, it reacts to Kemurikusa.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:54.350
Watch the ground too.
It can transfer the root like Midori-san.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:55.310
Got it.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.860
I'll get to the trunk and sever it.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.490
Yes, I'll try to control it too.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.820
Let's go. This must be Riri's destiny.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.070
What?

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:36.020
I saw it in the Memory Leaf.
It nullifies Kemurikusa.

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:37.980
But Midori will work.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:39.150
Okay.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:47.120
It's not as strong as a branch,
but it's at max output.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.830
Sever the trunk with it.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.660
Okay. This is our last Midori.
I'll finish this.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.770
It's...

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.650
Rin-san! It's the same as Island Nine.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.400
We're out of Midori.
I'm using my main body.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:44.300
Rin-san!

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.560
Rin-san...

00:05:58.440 --> 00:05:59.440
I know.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.340
Rin-san!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.590
Hey!

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.600
Use that. Block it!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.120
Hey...

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.750
Extract and divide.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.760
6 leaves for the body and 1 for memory.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:12.720
And reinforce the weakened parts.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:17.100
There. Now I just wait for it to process.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.310
It went smoother than I thought.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:22.690
I've written down notes too.
Just in case.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:26.730
Once the extraction is done,
I'll be split into 6 grown-ups.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:30.780
This feels so weird. My memories, huh?

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:33.780
Wow, it's pretty clear.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:39.290
That's it, I can check
where Wakaba is right now.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.550
No, that can't be...

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.970
Wakaba is already...

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:06.940
No... All this was for nothing...?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:18.370
I need to erase these notes.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:23.920
It's better that I,
no we, don't know about it.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.790
OUR MISSION IS TO SAVE WAKABA.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.340
LIVE FREELY AS YOU WISH.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:31.590
OUR MISSION IS...

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.430
Live freely...

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.450
So that's what happened.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.280
It's the same.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.990
It's not over yet.
I can still use my main body.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.330
Huh?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.830
I'm out of water.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.300
Is this the end?

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.590
It's the same as Riri.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:20.970
Sis, I'm out of water.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.220
Midori too.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.390
I'm going back.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:25.440
Rin.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.560
Sis, Rina.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:32.070
I can't use my roots,
so I'm sending you a message.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:36.280
We're fine over here.
You treasure what you love.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:39.950
You don't mean
Sis Rin still hasn't noticed?

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.370
Such a dummy.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.450
What I love...?

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.880
Sis, Rina!

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.300
You can use this if you want.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.090
It'll come in handy.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.890
This is...

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.860
Sorry for making you do
everything for us all this time.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:20.030
Now, you do what you love.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:23.580
-It's your turn now.
-Thanks for everything.

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.040
Sis, Rina...

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:33.380
If you're still lost, just look at
which way your feet are pointed.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.840
Get a good look at what you want to do.

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.390
What I want to do...

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.430
Not Riri.

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:52.110
But me. What I want to do.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.950
Are you okay with this?

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.250
Sure! Rina got to eat
all the things Rina likes.

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:13.290
Me too. Rin always made sure
we could do what we loved.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:19.880
SHIRO PROTECT RINA, RITSU.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:21.970
HELP WAKABA, RIN. MY PURPOSE.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:25.760
-I can't read, but I know.
-We all feel the same.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:29.100
-Let's do this.
-We won't let them through.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:30.600
-For Sis.
-For Rin.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.190
For what she loves!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.330
Hey, wake up! Hey!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:28.800
Wakaba!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.740
There you go, you got it.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.450
Aww, look at yourself.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.950
It's what you love.
Took you long enough to figure it out.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:56.540
Why...?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:59.170
In the Memory Leaf that you had.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:02.250
You're so dense. Couldn't you feel it?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.550
She sure isn't the brightest one.

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.720
That's how hard
everything has been for you.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.300
You've done a great job.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.390
Leave it to us now.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:18.480
That's what you want, right?
Then brace yourself.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:22.150
What a great way to use what I have left.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:38.120
That thing's such a pain.
Let's get rid of it.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:59.980
Get a load of this!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:09.820
Over here.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:15.870
Darn. There's nothing interesting
about that trunk.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.010
It's meaningless if you can't hit me.

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:35.300
Also, when Rin beat the same one...

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.060
I was watching.

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:51.990
A wall, this is so great.
An unusual wall too.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.160
This is so exciting!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:04.420
From above, you go like this.
From the side, like that. Yes, yes!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.300
Hmm? Is that it?

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:10.880
And then...

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.680
Slash!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.980
-Rin.
-See ya.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.230
Go on.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.500
Rin-san...

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.090
Are you okay?

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.380
Yes.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.220
How's the red tree?

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:45.690
Wow, you defeated it! You did it!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.940
I'm surprised you pulled through.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.480
Midori-san protected me.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:56.740
You still had this with you?

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.530
Because you wrapped it around me.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.370
Thank you for saving me again.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:09.000
Rin-san? What's...?

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.250
Shut up.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.750
Just hold on.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:18.340
Hey, messy hair.

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.510
Well and alive, huh.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:23.260
-Congratulations.
-You did it.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:25.770
-You guys!
-You're here.

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:27.940
Yes, thanks to you.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:31.900
What Rin loves, huh.
I don't see what's so great.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.360
I know, right?

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.530
But that Memory Leaf.
That means this place is...

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:41.700
Anyways, I guess that's it for us.

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:42.660
Yup.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.830
No, we're finally together!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:48.580
We already said our goodbyes before.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.330
We've all got what we love now.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.210
I couldn't be happier.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:57.300
Better not let it go, Rin. Hold on tight.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:00.970
You too. This is the very end of the ship.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.850
You better research it.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:07.020
Later, you two.
Say hi to Ricchan and Rina-chan for us.

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:11.810
Thank you.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.270
What is this place?

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:17.150
Wow, what a huge leaf!

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:24.280
Is that...?

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.740
Sis, Rina!

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.040
How is it over there?

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:30.790
The red roots are disappearing,
so I guess we won?

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.330
We finished them off somehow too.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.000
We worked hard.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:40.550
It says that it trusts you two are safe.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:46.680
Yup. Since it's all over,
we don't have to talk differently anymore.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.100
Come to think of it, you're right.

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.560
But it's become a habit now.

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.730
Yup, it sure has.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.150
Take your time getting back now.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:04.070
We'll last for another few days.

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:06.280
Come back together, okay?

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:09.830
-Bye!
-See you!

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.300
We did it, huh?

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.180
Yeah...

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.180
But we're out of water.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.850
We won't make it back to Island Seven.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:35.150
Guess we'll just relax here.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:36.610
Rin-san.

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:39.020
Your expression has loosened up.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.610
Maybe you're right.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:43.240
What is it?

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.500
That's...

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.710
What's wrong?

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.460
I don't want you leaving me again.

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:37.690
What is this place?

00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:49.410
Is it... Huh?

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:53.280
Oh, the ship... We're outside the ship!

00:22:54.490 --> 00:22:56.870
Look at that, Rin-san!

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:59.250
It's water, all of it!

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:02.080
Ritsu-san and Rina-san
will be healthy again.

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:04.840
You can do what you love now too.

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:26.440
I'm really glad.

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:28.820
Wakaba.

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:38.410
I love you.
